{"unit_id":"tag:08S3:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若我们的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>是局部完全交（local complete intersection），则存在一个解（solution）。这是一种提升（lifting）结果；注意，对于辛托米（syntomic）环映射（ring maps），我们已在《光滑化环映射（Ring Maps）》，命题<REF_0001>中证明了一个相当强的提升（lifting）结果。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"local complete intersection","target_term":"局部完全交"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"lifting","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"辛托米"},{"source_term":"ring maps","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"Ring Maps","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"lifting","target_term":"提升"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"给定代数映射。"},{"source_term":"local complete intersection","target_term":"局部完全交","context":"保证提升存在的性质。"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"前述提升问题的解。"},{"source_term":"lifting","target_term":"提升","context":"沿环的扩张提升。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"辛托米","context":"来源环映射的专门性质，音译待决。"},{"source_term":"ring maps","target_term":"环映射","context":"同一类代数映射的复数。"},{"source_term":"Ring Maps","target_term":"环映射","context":"引用章节标题的组成部分。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08S6:statement","translation":"若<MATH_0001>是局部完全交（local complete intersection）环映射（ring map），则（<REF_0001>）存在一个解（solution）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"local complete intersection","target_term":"局部完全交"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"local complete intersection","target_term":"局部完全交","context":"本引理环映射的性质。"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"本引理的代数映射。"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"所引用问题的解。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08S6:proof","translation":"第一种证明<PROOFARGEND_0001>写成<MATH_0001>。由《更多代数（Algebra）》，定义<REF_0001>，理想（ideal）<MATH_0002>是 Koszul 正则（Koszul-regular）的。这蕴含<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>正则（regular）且拟正则（quasi-regular）的，见《更多代数（Algebra）》，第<REF_0002>节。令<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>的逆（inverse）像（image）。以<MATH_0007>记<MATH_0008>的核（kernel）。由《更多代数（Algebra）》，引理<REF_0003>，有<MATH_0009>。因此得到一个短正合列（short exact sequence）<MATH_0010>。由于<MATH_0011>是投射（projective）的（《更多代数（Algebra）》，引理<REF_0004>），我们可以选择此列的一个分裂（splitting）<MATH_0012>。令<MATH_0013>为在上述分解（decomposition）中映到第二个直和项（summand）的元素（elements）。那么<MATH_0014>是（<REF_0005>）的一个解（solution），其中<MATH_0015>。一般情形由沿给定映射（map）<MATH_0016>作推出（pushout）得到。\n","allowed_english":["Koszul"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"Koszul-regular","target_term":"Koszul 正则"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"quasi-regular","target_term":"拟正则"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"summand","target_term":"直和项"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"被引用章节标题。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"多项式环的定义理想。"},{"source_term":"Koszul-regular","target_term":"Koszul 正则","context":"来源所用的理想正则性。"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则","context":"受保护的 H1 限定下的正则性质。"},{"source_term":"quasi-regular","target_term":"拟正则","context":"理想的性质。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"逆像的限定词。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"所取理想的逆像。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"环映射的核。"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"所构造的模列。"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射","context":"余法模的性质。"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂","context":"短正合列的分裂。"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解","context":"上式的直和分解。"},{"source_term":"summand","target_term":"直和项","context":"所选第二项。"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"定义 J 双撇的原像元素。"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"所构造的提升解。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定模映射。"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出","context":"沿给定映射的推出构造。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08S6:proof-002","translation":"第二种证明<PROOFARGEND_0001>请先阅读注记<REF_0001>，再阅读本证明。由《更多代数（Algebra）》，引理<REF_0002>，映射（maps）<MATH_0001>确实构成<MATH_0002>中的一个可区别三角（distinguished triangle）。因此只需证明<MATH_0003>消失（vanishes）。由《更多代数（Algebra）》，引理<REF_0003>，复形（complex）<MATH_0004>是完美（perfect）的，且其 Tor 振幅（tor-amplitude）位于<MATH_0005>。这蕴含我们的<MATH_0006>消失（vanishes），例如可由《更多代数（Algebra）》，引理<REF_0004>的第（1）部分得出。\n","allowed_english":["Tor"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"可区别三角"},{"source_term":"vanishes","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"},{"source_term":"tor-amplitude","target_term":"Tor 振幅"},{"source_term":"vanishes","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章节标题。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"导出范畴中的映射。"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"可区别三角","context":"导出范畴的三角。"},{"source_term":"vanishes","target_term":"消失","context":"Ext 群为零。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"朴素余切复形。"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美","context":"该复形的有限投射性质。"},{"source_term":"tor-amplitude","target_term":"Tor 振幅","context":"复形的 Tor 次数范围。"}],"notes":[]}
